Besides the question of translating the existing game into German, it
would be interesting to think about folklore particular to German.  (I'm
only thinking about this just for fun.)  For example, if there were a
German version of the game, it would seem a shame not to have an
Erlkoenig monster, who, if you #chatted with him, would respond, "Gar
schoene Spiele spiel' ich mit dir!"  Of course it would be an awful lot
of work to reinvent the NH bestiary -- but kind of fun to think about.

